body: "## Scope\\n\\nRecover the repository from accumulated dependency and automation drift while preserving CLI behavior and release quality. The goal covers GitHub advisory triage, runtime and development dependency upgrades, Actions modernization, source/security review, package verification, and durable pm governance.\\n\\n## Success measures\\n\\n- Zero known dependency vulnerabilities in the resolved lockfile.\\n- All required local and GitHub checks pass on one coherent upgrade head.\\n- Existing Dependabot backlog is superseded without losing issue lineage.\\n- Repository-local pm state captures goals, plans, findings, evidence, and future improvements."
